---
// Footer.astro - 올케어탄성 공통 푸터
---

<footer class="w-full bg-[#FAF8F5] border-t border-[#E7D9C1] py-10 sm:py-14 text-[#5C5549]">
  <div class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-[#E7D9C1]">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-base font-bold text-[#3E443B]">올케어탄성</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#5C5549] bg-[#E7D9C1]/50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">ALLCARE</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5C5549]">
          서울권 탄성코트 · 베란다탄성코트 전문 시공 안내
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
        <div class="text-left sm:text-right">
          <span class="text-xs text-[#5C5549] block">시공 및 견적 상담</span>
          <a
            href="tel:01084926900"
            class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3E443B] hover:text-[#4F5844] transition-colors"
          >
            010-8492-6900
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-[#5C5549]/80 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        서비스 권역: 서울특별시 전역 (서울권)
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5C5549]/70">
        ※ 본 페이지는 현장 바탕면 상태(들뜸, 균열, 곰팡이, 결로)에 따른 작업 범위와 시공 정보를 정직하게 안내합니다.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5C5549]/60 pt-2">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} 올케어탄성. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
